WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.496
The band played as two large, masked creatures jumped onto the stage.

2
00:00:07.497 --> 00:00:11.557
One looked like a scary lion made of straw.

3
00:00:11.558 --> 00:00:17.861
The other had long hair, bulging eyes, and pointy fingernails.

4
00:00:17.862 --> 00:00:21.952
"What is this dance about?" asked Mandy.

5
00:00:21.953 --> 00:00:26.744
"This is a story of good and evil," explained Nyoman.

6
00:00:26.745 --> 00:00:31.778
"The lion protects his people and land from an evil spirit."

7
00:00:31.779 --> 00:00:36.366
She pointed to the two dancers in strange costumes.

8
00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:39.711
Mandy clapped her hands excitedly.

9
00:00:39.712 --> 00:00:43.335
She was scared and amazed at the same time.

10
00:00:43.336 --> 00:00:48.979
On the other side of the crowd, Vinnie was watching the dance too.

11
00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:55.116
"Cool!" he kept saying. "Look at that mask!"

12
00:00:55.117 --> 00:00:57.465
"Watch the lion’s helpers,"

13
00:00:57.466 --> 00:01:02.501
said Wayan as men in checkered clothes jumped out.

14
00:01:02.502 --> 00:01:06.161
"They have knives!" shouted Vinnie.

15
00:01:06.162 --> 00:01:12.216
"Yes. The evil spirit will soon put a spell on them," said Wayan.

16
00:01:12.217 --> 00:01:18.066
Vinnie noticed Mandy in the crowd with Nyoman and her family.

17
00:01:18.067 --> 00:01:20.526
"Hey! There’s my sister!"

18
00:01:20.527 --> 00:01:24.546
he shouted and ran over.

19
00:01:24.547 --> 00:01:27.865
"Where have you been?" she asked.

20
00:01:27.866 --> 00:01:32.199
"It’s a long story," said Vinnie.

21
00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:35.431
He told her about the rumbling volcano.

22
00:01:35.432 --> 00:01:37.364
The dance ended.

23
00:01:37.365 --> 00:01:42.681
People began to leave the village center, walking in happy groups.

24
00:01:42.682 --> 00:01:46.290
Wayan came over to Vinnie and Mandy.

25
00:01:46.291 --> 00:01:50.181
"We’ll make our offerings now," said Wayan.

26
00:01:50.182 --> 00:01:53.962
"Where is the temple?" asked Mandy.

27
00:01:53.963 --> 00:01:58.406
"It’s on the slopes of that mountain," said Nyoman.

28
00:01:58.407 --> 00:02:02.271
"It is the most important temple in all of Bali.

29
00:02:02.272 --> 00:02:05.764
We call it the Mother Temple."

30
00:02:05.765 --> 00:02:10.499
"It’s the only temple anyone can enter," added Wayan.

31
00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:14.085
"What do you mean?" asked Mandy.

32
00:02:14.086 --> 00:02:20.628
"You have to belong to a special group to worship at other temples," explained Nyoman.

33
00:02:20.629 --> 00:02:24.801
"At Mother Temple, everyone is welcome."

34
00:02:24.802 --> 00:02:28.337
"I don’t know if it’s a good idea to go there,"

35
00:02:28.338 --> 00:02:32.162
said Vinnie, remembering the shaking ground.

36
00:02:32.163 --> 00:02:36.423
"We are not afraid of the mountain god," said Wayan.

37
00:02:36.424 --> 00:02:40.754
"The Mother Temple protects us from his rumblings."

38
00:02:40.755 --> 00:02:42.884
Vinnie stopped.

39
00:02:42.885 --> 00:02:45.987
"I don’t want to go up there again, Mandy,"

40
00:02:45.988 --> 00:02:49.468
he whispered, grabbing his sister’s arm.

41
00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:51.784
"It’s a volcano!"

42
00:02:51.785 --> 00:02:56.179
Mandy suddenly gasped as she stared ahead.

43
00:02:56.180 --> 00:03:00.516
On the slope of the mountain was a large temple.

44
00:03:00.517 --> 00:03:04.281
The village people were all heading toward it.

45
00:03:04.282 --> 00:03:09.262
"Vinnie, look!" Mandy pulled the photo out.

46
00:03:09.263 --> 00:03:11.755
It was glowing blue.

47
00:03:11.756 --> 00:03:15.578
"We’re in the right place," Vinnie said.

48
00:03:15.579 --> 00:03:18.743
"But what’s everyone holding?"

49
00:03:18.744 --> 00:03:23.636
"Mandy! Vinnie! Come on," Nyoman called to them.

50
00:03:23.637 --> 00:03:26.612
"We must take our offerings to the gods."

51
00:03:26.613 --> 00:03:29.232
She quickly walked on ahead.

52
00:03:29.233 --> 00:03:33.480
"What’s in their hands?" Vinnie asked again.

53
00:03:33.481 --> 00:03:38.745
As they got closer, they saw people walking up the steps.

54
00:03:38.746 --> 00:03:42.146
Everyone held something in their hands.

55
00:03:42.147 --> 00:03:45.495
Mandy looked at the photo and smiled.

56
00:03:45.496 --> 00:03:49.146
The offerings in the photo were glowing red.

57
00:03:49.147 --> 00:03:53.270
"Flowers," Mandy said, pointing.

58
00:03:53.271 --> 00:03:58.058
Everyone was holding flowers wrapped in coconut leaves.

59
00:03:58.059 --> 00:04:02.729
Suddenly the children were blinded by the bright light.

60
00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:13.248
They fell down the dark tunnel and landed with a thump in the attic.

